          {HEADLINE.afcMilesNational.toLocaleString()} FHWA Alternative Fuel
          Corridor miles ??? {HEADLINE.unqualifiedMiles.toLocaleString()} miles
          still lack a qualifying pair under the 50-mile / 1-mile benchmark.
